WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
STEPHANIE WONG: Hey.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.210
It's day two of Next, and
wow, what an incredible day

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:03.810
one, right?

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.360
We had announcements around
data analytics, security,

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.700
sustainability, and
Google Workspace.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.065
And now we're on to day two.

00:00:10.065 --> 00:00:12.930
To give you a quick rundown
of what to look forward to,

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.940
we'll start the day with
the developer keynote.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.860
You'll hear from the
leaders and developers

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.170
who are bringing our
latest innovations to life,

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:22.050
Google Cloud's vision for the
top three technology trends,

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.750
and how cloud computing will
evolve over the next decade.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.360
And don't miss the live Q&amp;A
hosted by my fellow developer

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.380
advocates.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.450
For everyone looking to get more
out of your cloud investment--

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.290
which, let's face it, is
everyone-- check out the app

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:37.380
modernization spotlight, "Extend
the value of cloud investments

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.210
anywhere with Google Cloud."

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.210
Our VP of IaaS, VP
of app modernization,

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:43.785
and director of
product management

00:00:43.785 --> 00:00:45.910
will be talking about how
we're extending our cloud

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:50.640
services to address more complex
and unique use cases from data

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:52.140
center to the edge.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:54.640
You'll learn how to modernize
your people, processes,

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.600
and applications to take full
advantage of the distributed

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.460
cloud from Google.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.230
Then join them for
a live Q&amp;A session

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:03.240
to get your questions answered.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:05.640
For security-minded
leaders-- which, once again,

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.650
should be everyone--
here's your chance

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.680
to listen to our very own chief
information security officer

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.180
and our VP of security.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:14.100
They'll discuss how
to engineer security

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.950
directly into your
applications and platforms

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:20.130
to eliminate entire classes
of threats without friction.

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:22.590
They'll introduce the
invisible security vision

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:25.660
and discuss the key capabilities
that can make it a reality.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.360
And, yes, we will
have a live demo

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:29.970
in this one, plus
another live Q&amp;A.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.980
Channel 2 of the
broadcast will include

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.980
a bunch of customer stories,
like Saber, Broad Institute,

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:37.350
Meow Wolf, and
Papa John's, on how

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:40.650
they're leveraging Google Cloud
Security, data platform, VMware

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:41.700
Engine, and more.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.430
Don't forget we have learning
pathways to get hands-on.

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:46.680
Check out pathways for
cloud infrastructure, data

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.900
engineering and
analytics, Kubernetes,

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:52.920
hybrid and multi-cloud, ML and
AI, networking and security,

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:53.830
and more.

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:57.000
And we also have a multitude
of hands-on labs for Apigee,

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.350
Vertex AI, Cloud SQL, and more.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:02.130
Check out all the
sessions with the ID HOL.

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:04.590
Enjoy day two of Next
and connect on social

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.620
by hashtagging
#GoogleCloudNext, and reach out

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:10.190
to me @stephr_wong.

